# The API worker lives on eapi.basilpot.com. This is a server-side value only —
# browsers call the same-origin /api/v1/* path, which next.config.ts rewrites
# to API_BASE_URL. That proxy is why the storefront can stay on ashandmoss.com
# while the API moved: no Origin header ever reaches the worker, so CORS
# (which only allows basilpot.com) never applies to us.
API_BASE_URL=https://eapi.basilpot.com/api/v1